    <bpmn:process id="W_W2246" name="W2246. In-Store Coupon Redemption" isExecutable="false">
      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Customer presents coupon at POS
Frequency: ~50K–80K/month during campaigns
Volume: ~50K–80K/month; ~2% of transactions (of 2.8M/month)
Owner: Cashier
Participants: Store Manager
Source: workflow W2246 — In-Store Coupon Redemption</bpmn:documentation>
      <bpmn:laneSet id="W2246_LaneSet2">
        <bpmn:lane id="W2246_Lane1" name="Cashier">
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2246_Task4</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2246_Start3</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        <bpmn:flowNodeRef>W2246_End5</bpmn:flowNodeRef>
        </bpmn:lane>
      </bpmn:laneSet>
      <bpmn:startEvent id="W2246_Start3" name="Customer presents coupon at POS">
        <bpmn:outgoing>W2246_Flow8</bpmn:outgoing>
      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2246_Task4" name="Cashier scans the coupon barcode or enters the code; system validates (active…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Cashier scans the coupon barcode or enters the code; system validates (active, eligible SKU, min-spend met, not-expired, per-customer-limit); applies the discount; logs the redemption for vendor reconciliation and liability reduction
Responsible (R): Cashier / System
Accountable (A): Store Manager
Duration: 30 sec–1 min</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2246_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2246_End5" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2246_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2246_Annotation6">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-404 (ensure controlled execution — Coupon Redemption &amp; Fraud Prevention (PA-58.2).) | - operational: redemption/liability integrity; CTL-196 (coupon &amp; promo-code abuse prevention — fraud patterns monitored per W2249); operational: Store Manager daily-close review
Owner: Cashier</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
      <bpmn:association id="W2246_Assoc7" sourceRef="W2246_Annotation6" targetRef="W2246_Start3" associationDirection="None" />
