      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2247_Task4" name="Customer enters the promo code at ecommerce checkout; system validates and…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer enters the promo code at ecommerce checkout; system validates and applies; logs the redemption; updates the omnichannel liability in real-time
Responsible (R): Ecommerce System
Accountable (A): Ecom Ops Manager
Duration: Automated</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2247_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2247_End5" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2247_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2247_Annotation6">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-404 (ensure controlled execution — Coupon Redemption &amp; Fraud Prevention (PA-58.2).) | - operational: omnichannel liability integrity; CTL-196 (coupon &amp; promo-code abuse prevention — ecommerce redemption fraud monitored alongside VS-125); operational: Ecom Ops Manager monitoring
Owner: Ecommerce System</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
