      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:serviceTask id="W2252_Task4" name="Customer claims a digital coupon to their loyalty account/app; system binds the…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Customer claims a digital coupon to their loyalty account/app; system binds the coupon to the account (per-customer-limit enforcement); coupon available for redemption at POS (loyalty lookup) or online (account login)
Responsible (R): IT Integration Lead / System
Accountable (A): CIO
Duration: Per campaign + ongoing</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2252_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:serviceTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2252_End5" name="Complete">
        <bpmn:incoming>W2252_Flow9</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:endEvent>
      <bpmn:textAnnotation id="W2252_Annotation6">
        <bpmn:text>Controls: - CTL-404 (ensure controlled execution — Coupon Redemption &amp; Fraud Prevention (PA-58.2).) | - CTL-404 (coupon-binding integrity); CTL-196 (multi-account abuse prevention — links to VS-125); operational: IT Integration Lead monitoring
Owner: IT Integration Lead</bpmn:text>
      </bpmn:textAnnotation>
