      <bpmn:documentation>Trigger: Monthly vendor settlement
Frequency: Monthly; ~10–15 vendor campaigns
Volume: ~10–15 reconciliations/month
Owner: Finance Analyst
Participants: Finance Manager
Source: workflow W2253 — Coupon Vendor Reconciliation</bpmn:documentation>
