      </bpmn:startEvent>
      <bpmn:userTask id="W2253_Task4" name="Finance Analyst reconciles the vendor-funded coupon redemptions: BuildRight&#x27;s…">
        <bpmn:documentation>Step 1: Finance Analyst reconciles the vendor-funded coupon redemptions: BuildRight&#x27;s redemption count vs. the vendor&#x27;s record; calculates the reimbursement; submits the claim; vendor validates and credits
Responsible (R): Finance Analyst
Accountable (A): Finance Manager
Duration: 2–3 days/month</bpmn:documentation>
        <bpmn:incoming>W2253_Flow8</bpmn:incoming>
      </bpmn:userTask>
      <bpmn:endEvent id="W2253_End5" name="Complete">
